# Prose & Chapter Writing Rules

## Readability

* **Simpler prose in action scenes** — shorter sentences, plain words, fast flow. Save density for Aeric's internal voice, not narration soup.
* Live in Aeric's head first; action second. Zack-style internal dialogue: questions, bitter jokes, option-weighing.

## Null Cycling sensation (locked — do not blur)

| Action | Sensation |
|--------|-----------|
| **Ambient draw** (air into hollow) | **Neutral / easy** — not painful |
| **Touch-leech** (dying target, bare skin) | **Pleasurable** dark rush — addiction hook |
| **Sediment flush** (push mud out) | **Agony** — friction / molten-wire drag |
| **Meridian Opening** (force new path) | **Separate friction-pain** — not leech pain |
| **Painful Reconstruction** (heal with stolen vitality) | **Agony** after the good leech |

*Ch1 technique block still says ambient is agonizing — align on next Ch1 pass.*

## Mariusz teaches step-by-step

When Aeric learns or repeats a **new or risky procedure** (sediment burn, meridian open, first butcher pass):

1. Mariusz **stops him** if he's guessing — *"You don't know this yet. Listen."*
2. **Numbered steps** — find hollow → draw ambient → don't overdraw → push/vent/etc.
3. Aeric executes **during** the steps, not before.
4. Never let Aeric **just know** a technique without prior void tutorial or Mariusz walkthrough.

## No Shop

* **Never** mention shop, marketplace, or mercy aisle in Mariusz dialogue or Aeric thoughts unless explicitly deconstructing a **false expectation**.
* Upgrade Auditor / Aether Currency ≠ a store UI.

## Environment (Discovery POV)

* One sharp **survival-tied** detail every few pages: wrong scale, buried metal (bus, car door, sign), Aether-thick pockets, sound layers.
* Aeric **misreads** scale and wreckage — no omniscient ×1000 exposition.
* Do not wiki-name **Shattered Primeval Forest** until earned.

## Memory splinters

See `.cursor/rules/aeric-backstory.mdc`. **1–2 lines**, trigger → past → **back to now**. No Act I flashback scenes.

## STATUS / CYCLE AUDIT layout (site + chapters)

Use HTML blockquote for reader site (yellow diffs):

```html
<blockquote class="status-block">
<p><strong>[ STATUS ]</strong></p>
<p><strong>Name:</strong> Aeric Ryder</p>
<p><strong>Meridians Cleared:</strong> <span class="stat-changed">5 / 108</span> <span class="stat-was">(was 4 / 108)</span></p>
...
</blockquote>
```

* **One field per line** (`<p>` each).
* **Changed values** since last STATUS in chapter: `<span class="stat-changed">` + `<span class="stat-was">(was …)</span>`.
* Sync all numbers to `@mc_sheet.md`.
* New skills: `[ NEW TECHNIQUE ]` breakdown + Mariusz monologue immediately after.

## Siphon on-page (always)

Kill with weapon → **separate beat** → bare palm on **dying** flesh → leech. Never off weapon still in wound.
